# Build artifacts + deps (reinstalled/rebuilt inside the image)
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
.turbo

# VCS + local tooling
.git
.github
.claude
.husky

# Test/coverage output
**/coverage
**/.vitest
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Logs + local env (compose injects env explicitly)
*.log
**/*.log
.env
**/.env
!**/.env.example

# Docs (not needed to build/run) — EXCEPT the normalized model catalog the
# seed importer (seed-catalog.ts) reads at seed runtime to populate model_spec +
# the trustworthy official_model_price cost basis.
docs
!docs/research
!docs/research/official-model-catalog-normalized.json
*.md
